# 🤖 Automation-First Approach

**Philosophy:** Don't delete features. Automate them. Track usage. Audit later.

---

## Current Automations (Already Running)

| What | Schedule | Status |
|:-----|:---------|:-------|
| Nightly Agent | Cron 2am | ✅ Active |
| Knowledge Indexer | Part of nightly | ✅ Active |
| Daily Digest | Part of nightly | ✅ Active |
| Events Logging | On every action | ✅ Active |

---

## What Should Be Automatic (But Isn't Yet)

| Feature | Current Trigger | Make Automatic |
|:--------|:----------------|:---------------|
| Research queue | Manual `/research` | ✅ Nightly processes queue |
| Ideas reminder | None | Add to Telegram summary if ideas > 3 |
| Sprint progress | Manual check | Include in nightly digest |

**Good news:** Research queue is already integrated into nightly_agent.py. It will run automatically at 2am.

---

## Telegram: No Manual Commands Needed

| Instead of... | It Does Automatically... |
|:--------------|:-------------------------|
| `/status` every day | Nightly sends you summary |
| `/tasks` | Included in nightly summary |
| Checking `/idea` inbox | Nightly reminds if pending |

**You only need commands when you want to ADD something:**
- `/idea` → capture thought
- `/research` → queue task
- `/sprint` → start new focus

---

## Usage Tracking (Already Happening)

Every action emits an event to [events.jsonl](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/.brain/ledger/events.jsonl):

```json
{"event_type": "idea_captured", "timestamp": "..."}
{"event_type": "research_queued", "timestamp": "..."}
{"event_type": "sprint_started", "timestamp": "..."}
```

**After 2 weeks, we can query:**
- How many ideas captured?
- How many research tasks completed?
- Which commands used most?

---

## Audit Schedule

| Date | Action |
|:-----|:-------|
| Jan 14, 2025 | Review events.jsonl for usage |
| Jan 14, 2025 | Check which features have 0 usage |
| Jan 14, 2025 | Decide what to deprecate |

---

## Your Zero-Effort Daily Experience

| Time | What Happens | Your Action |
|:-----|:-------------|:------------|
| **Anytime** | Have an idea | `/idea <thought>` via Telegram |
| **Anytime** | Want research | `/research <topic>` via Telegram |
| **2am** | Nightly agent runs | None (automatic) |
| **Morning** | Telegram summary arrives | Read it |
| **Morning** | Research results ready | Optional: review in `.brain/artifacts/research/` |

---

## Summary

| Before | After |
|:-------|:------|
| "Too many commands" | Use 2: `/idea`, `/research` |
| "Nothing runs" | Everything runs at 2am |
| "Don't know what exists" | Telegram summary tells you |
| "Is this useful?" | Audit after 2 weeks |

**No changes needed. System is already set up to run automatically.**
